

Polokalama pulega-manatua: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Moni.
>> a := Lisi ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Mea fou.
c pe-a-oo-mai: ['greet:'] fai: { Tuuina-atu tusi: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Polokalama faamama.
>> usedMemory1 := (Polokalama manatua-masini ? 0).




x := 1.
